		{"id":"263fa433587f39a9","x":1277,"y":300,"width":512,"height":254,"color":"2","type":"text","text":"### What you should be able to do\n\n- choose between **past simple** and **past continuous**\n- use common **irregular past verbs**\n- understand and use the Chapter 1 vocabulary\n- describe a **past holiday**\n- explain what happened during the holiday"},
		{"id":"df6b2383cdb65cc2","x":1277,"y":-107,"width":590,"height":351,"color":"2","type":"text","text":"### Grammar\n\n- **Past simple**: finished actions in the past  \n    _We went to the beach yesterday._\n- **Past continuous**: actions that were in progress in the past  \n    _We were swimming at 3 p.m._\n- **Past simple + past continuous**: use the past continuous for the longer action and the past simple for the shorter event  \n    _I was walking home when it started to rain._\n- Know the required **irregular verbs**, especially their past simple forms."},
		{"id":"6d067b4fa9bb0462","x":435,"y":103,"width":683,"height":826,"color":"2","type":"text","text":"## Creative Task: Create a Mini Chapter 1 Test in groups of 2-3 \n\nYou are now the teacher.\n\nCreate a **mini test for your classmates on paper** about Chapter 1. Your test should be challenging, but fair.\n\n### Your mini test must contain 10 questions\n\n- **2 Past simple questions**\n- **2 Past continuous questions**\n- **2 Past simple vs. past continuous questions**\n- **2 Irregular verb questions**\n- **1 Vocabulary question**\n- **1 Holiday/Stones question**\n\n### Make it creative\n\nDo not only write fill-in-the-blank questions. Use at least **3 different question types**, for example:\n\n- Fill in the correct verb\n- Correct the mistake\n- Multiple choice\n- Translate a word\n- Finish a sentence\n- Write a question based on a picture or situation\n- Give two sentences and ask which one is correct\n- Create a short holiday story with missing words"}
	],
